    "title": "Recap: A Record-Setting Championship Game - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Thomas Leibrandt ,\n1 days ago Winning an NCAA Basketball Championship is thrilling. For the University of Michigan — it also turned out to be historic. Very historic. Michigan is now the first NCAA Program to win an NCAA Basketball Championship with five transfer starters. It’s also the second Championship for the University since 1989. It’s the first title for the Big Ten since 2000. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
